rs first, so it can be run again and again.</p><p>UR5e A loads a base into the fixture and sets <b>BASE_READY</b>. UR5e B waits for it, presses a cap onto the base (the cap is released onto the base, so it moves with it) and sets <b>CAP_DONE</b>; then UR5e A takes the assembled part to the output tray.</p>"}}],"geometry":{"g2":"H4sIAAAAAAAAE2NoMDzCwLDqMAMINCgdYWDoQWLDxA3R2D1Y1EPVNBi6wPXC2T1QNroaZHE0NRhuQDYTixqs5uPyVw9uNbjcj+F3QzT1eMSR/Yg1PFfhVoMWPgC8flxSsAEAAA==","g3":"H4sIAAAAAAAAE2NoMDzCwHDCmQEEGpSOMDA8Q2LDxA3R2M+wqIeqaTB0geuFs59B2ehqkMXR1GC4AdlMLGqwmo/LX89wq8Hlfgy/G6KpxyOO7Ees4XkCtxq08AEAbXqxj7ABAAA=","g4":"H4sIAAAAAAAAE2NoUHJhYFh1mAEEGgxdGBh6kNgwcSU0dg8W9VA1IDGYXji7B8pGV4MsjqYGww3IZmJRg9V8XP7qwa0Gl/sx/K6Eph6POLIfsYbnKtxq0MIHALaWJa+wAQAA","g5":"H4sIAAAAAAAAE2NoUHJhYDjhzAACDYYuDAzPkNgwcSU09jMs6qFqQGIwvXD2MygbXQ2yOJoaDDcgm4lFDVbzcfnrGW41uNyP4XclNPV4xJH9iDU8T+BWgxY+AGeSyHKwAQAA","g6":"H4sIAAAAAAAAE2NoUDrCwLD0MAODhzNDg5ILA8NEJDZc/AgqeyI29VA1BUh6C5DUFGBRgyyOrgbDDchmYlGDzXxc/pqIRw0u92P4/QiqenziBVj0ooctLjWo4QMAsiKZVrABAAA=","g7":"H4sIAAAAAAAAE2NoUDrCwHDWmYHBw5mhQcmFgeEhEhsufgSV/RCbeqiaAiS9BUhqCrCoQRZHV4PhBmQzsajBZj4ufz3EowaX+zH8fgRVPT7xAix60cMWlxrU8AEA/YpZJrABAAA=","g1":"","g8":"","g10":"H4sIAAAAAAAAE2NgMDnEwFBwiIFBwZGBwcSJgcEAiQ0XP4TKNsCmHqpGwAmhF8Y2gLEP4RZHV4PhBmQzsajBZj4ufxngUYPL/Rh+P4SqHp84sh+xhWcBHjWo4QMA9plB7bABAAA=","g11":"H4sIAAAAAAAAE2NgMDnEwGDgxMCg4MjAYOLEwFCAxIaLH0JlF2BTD1Uj4ITQC2MXwNiHcIujq8FwA7KZWNRgMx+XvwrwqMHlfgy/H0JVj08c2Y/YwtMAjxrU8AEApuuDfLABAAA=","g9":"","g12":"","g14":"","g15":"","g13":"","g16":"","g17":""},"library":[{"item":"rob5","file":"UR5e.robot","kind":"robot"},{"item":"too6","file":"RobotiQ-2F-85-Gripper-Open.tool","kind":"tool"},{"item":"rob9","file":"UR3e.robot","kind":"robot"},{"item":"too10","file":"RobotiQ-2F-85-Gripper-Open.tool","kind":"tool"}]}